  "description": "Chemical Guys Hex-Logic Finishing Pad Black (6.5\") (Pack of 3) - Ultra Soft Foam Pads for Wax, Sealant and Glaze Application on Large Plates - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Hex-Logic pads are designed and engineered for today's most demanding detail professionals. Designed, engineered and tested to the strictest and highest requirements of our OEM customers. These pads use the best foams from around the world and the latest testing and research and development. Unlike traditional pads, the Hex-Logic pads use a precision system, laser cut hexagons to not only distribute the right amount of product throughout the pad, but also provide 100% coverage on flat or rounded/angled surfaces. Similar to the way bees build a honeycomb nest to distribute honey and pollen evenly, the Hex-Logic Pads hold the product in the rains during launch and while the pad is spun and rubbed against the surface, the polish migrates the hex grooves evenly into the pad, delivering a superior, precise finish, while constantly lubricating the surface to reduce friction and damage. The pad's unique laser-cut surface allows Hex-Logic pads to conform to the shape of the surface, providing maximum surface contact while evenly distributing the product throughout the pad to minimize heat.",
